  Run Fast Deploy for your clients: WHMCS requests, billing queue and account
  confirmation

  Usage: bladecp partner migrations <command> [options]

  Commands ───────────────────────────────────
  list                     List the Fast Deploy requests of a WHMCS
                           installation
  show <request>           Show a request: phase, components, preview and
                           billing
  review <request>         Confirm the domain of the site found in the backup
  approve <request>        Approve the preview so BladeCP finishes the
