  cancel <request>         Cancel a request that is not approved yet
  retry <request>          Try a failed migration again, when that is safe
  billing-queue            List the requests waiting for the billing WHMCS
  billing-link <request>   Link a request to its client and service in the
                           billing WHMCS
  claim-url <request>      Get the address where the account holder confirms
                           the account

  Details of a command: bladecp partner migrations <command> --help"
`;

